<title>USA: Beaver Area SD CABs, Pa., won by Dean Witter.</title>
<headline>Beaver Area SD CABs, Pa., won by Dean Witter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dean Witter Reynolds Inc said it won $1.250 million of Beaver Area School District, general obligation capital appreciation bonds, Series B of 1996, with a true interest cost of 6.05 percent.</p>
</text>
